{
  "file" : "npc/custom/etc/blackjack.txt",
  "scripts" : [
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 21,
      "npc" : "Black Jack Dealer",
      "text" : "[Dealer]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 22,
      "npc" : "Black Jack Dealer",
      "text" : "Hello there! Would you like to play a game of Black Jack?"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "option",
      "line" : 25,
      "npc" : "Black Jack Dealer",
      "text" : "What are the rules?"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "option",
      "line" : 25,
      "npc" : "Black Jack Dealer",
      "text" : "I want to play."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "option",
      "line" : 25,
      "npc" : "Black Jack Dealer",
      "text" : "No thanks."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 28,
      "npc" : "Black Jack Dealer",
      "text" : "[Dealer]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 29,
      "npc" : "Black Jack Dealer",
      "text" : "What would you like to know?"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "option",
      "line" : 32,
      "npc" : "Black Jack Dealer",
      "text" : "The basics."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "option",
      "line" : 32,
      "npc" : "Black Jack Dealer",
      "text" : "Winning and loosing."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "option",
      "line" : 32,
      "npc" : "Black Jack Dealer",
      "text" : "'Double Down'."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "option",
      "line" : 32,
      "npc" : "Black Jack Dealer",
      "text" : "Ace value."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "option",
      "line" : 32,
      "npc" : "Black Jack Dealer",
      "text" : "Nothing."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 36,
      "npc" : "Black Jack Dealer",
      "text" : "[Dealer]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 37,
      "npc" : "Black Jack Dealer",
      "text" : "Black Jack is a card game in which the goal is to get 21, or as"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 38,
      "npc" : "Black Jack Dealer",
      "text" : "close to 21 points as possible, without going over 21."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 40,
      "npc" : "Black Jack Dealer",
      "text" : "[Dealer]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 41,
      "npc" : "Black Jack Dealer",
      "text" : "Before the game starts, the player must make a bet.  Once the bet"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 42,
      "npc" : "Black Jack Dealer",
      "text" : "has been made, both the dealer and the player are dealt 2 cards"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 43,
      "npc" : "Black Jack Dealer",
      "text" : "each.  Depending on what cards you have, you can choose to ^5533FF'stay'^000000,"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 44,
      "npc" : "Black Jack Dealer",
      "text" : "or you can choose to ^5533FF'pull'^000000."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 46,
      "npc" : "Black Jack Dealer",
      "text" : "[Dealer]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 47,
      "npc" : "Black Jack Dealer",
      "text" : "When you choose to 'stay', you are telling the dealer that you don't"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 48,
      "npc" : "Black Jack Dealer",
      "text" : "need anymore cards.  This allows the dealer to pull if he/she"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 49,
      "npc" : "Black Jack Dealer",
      "text" : "wants to.  In order to stay, you must have ^FF3355at least 13 points^000000. The"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 50,
      "npc" : "Black Jack Dealer",
      "text" : "dealer can only stay when he/she has^FF3355 17 points or more^000000."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 52,
      "npc" : "Black Jack Dealer",
      "text" : "[Dealer]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 53,
      "npc" : "Black Jack Dealer",
      "text" : "When you choose to 'pull', you are telling the dealer that you want"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 54,
      "npc" : "Black Jack Dealer",
      "text" : "another card.  By pulling more cards you can increase your point"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 55,
      "npc" : "Black Jack Dealer",
      "text" : "total.  As long has you have ^FF3355less than 21^000000 points you can pull a"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 56,
      "npc" : "Black Jack Dealer",
      "text" : "card from the deck."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 59,
      "npc" : "Black Jack Dealer",
      "text" : "[Dealer]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 60,
      "npc" : "Black Jack Dealer",
      "text" : "There are 3 ways to win and loose at Black Jack."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 62,
      "npc" : "Black Jack Dealer",
      "text" : "[Dealer]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 63,
      "npc" : "Black Jack Dealer",
      "text" : "1.) At the end of a Black Jack round, if you have more points"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 64,
      "npc" : "Black Jack Dealer",
      "text" : "than the dealer you will win the round.  Conversely if you have"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 65,
      "npc" : "Black Jack Dealer",
      "text" : "less points than the dealer you will loose."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 67,
      "npc" : "Black Jack Dealer",
      "text" : "[Dealer]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 68,
      "npc" : "Black Jack Dealer",
      "text" : "2.) If you pull a card that makes your point total go over 21 you"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 69,
      "npc" : "Black Jack Dealer",
      "text" : "will automatically loose the round.  This is called a ^5533FF'bust'^000000.  If"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 70,
      "npc" : "Black Jack Dealer",
      "text" : "the dealer busts then you will win the round."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 72,
      "npc" : "Black Jack Dealer",
      "text" : "[Dealer]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 73,
      "npc" : "Black Jack Dealer",
      "text" : "3.) If you have a point total of 21 with the first 2 cards, you"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 74,
      "npc" : "Black Jack Dealer",
      "text" : "will automatically win the round.  This is called a ^5533FF'Black Jack'^000000"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 75,
      "npc" : "Black Jack Dealer",
      "text" : "and happens when you get an 'Ace' and a '10 valued' card. If the"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 76,
      "npc" : "Black Jack Dealer",
      "text" : "dealer gets a Black Jack he/she will automatically win the round."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 78,
      "npc" : "Black Jack Dealer",
      "text" : "[Dealer]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 79,
      "npc" : "Black Jack Dealer",
      "text" : "4.) Besides winning and loosing, you can tie with the dealer.  If"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 80,
      "npc" : "Black Jack Dealer",
      "text" : "both you and the dealer have the same point total at the end of a"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 81,
      "npc" : "Black Jack Dealer",
      "text" : "round, this will result in a tie with no winner and no loss or gain"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 82,
      "npc" : "Black Jack Dealer",
      "text" : "in money."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 84,
      "npc" : "Black Jack Dealer",
      "text" : "[Dealer]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 85,
      "npc" : "Black Jack Dealer",
      "text" : "This is called a ^5533FF'push'^000000 with the dealer.  This also"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 86,
      "npc" : "Black Jack Dealer",
      "text" : "applies to both you and the dealer having Black Jack at the same"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 87,
      "npc" : "Black Jack Dealer",
      "text" : "time."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 90,
      "npc" : "Black Jack Dealer",
      "text" : "[Dealer]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 91,
      "npc" : "Black Jack Dealer",
      "text" : "The 'Double Down' option allows you to double your current bet,"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 92,
      "npc" : "Black Jack Dealer",
      "text" : "but with the drawback that you will only be able to pull one"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 93,
      "npc" : "Black Jack Dealer",
      "text" : "additional card.  This option is only available at the beginning of"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 94,
      "npc" : "Black Jack Dealer",
      "text" : "each round."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 96,
      "npc" : "Black Jack Dealer",
      "text" : "[Dealer]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 97,
      "npc" : "Black Jack Dealer",
      "text" : "An example of when doubling down is useful, is when"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 98,
      "npc" : "Black Jack Dealer",
      "text" : "your first 2 cards give you a point total of 11.  You have a good"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 99,
      "npc" : "Black Jack Dealer",
      "text" : "chance of getting 21 or 20 with the next card that you draw.  This"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 100,
      "npc" : "Black Jack Dealer",
      "text" : "would be a good hand to double down on."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 103,
      "npc" : "Black Jack Dealer",
      "text" : "[Dealer]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 104,
      "npc" : "Black Jack Dealer",
      "text" : "The 'Ace' card is a unique card in the game of Black Jack because"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 105,
      "npc" : "Black Jack Dealer",
      "text" : "it can have 2 values.  An Ace can be counted as either 11 points,"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 106,
      "npc" : "Black Jack Dealer",
      "text" : "or just 1 point.  For example if you had an Ace and a 4, that would"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 107,
      "npc" : "Black Jack Dealer",
      "text" : "give you either 15 or 5 points."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 109,
      "npc" : "Black Jack Dealer",
      "text" : "[Dealer]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 110,
      "npc" : "Black Jack Dealer",
      "text" : "If you decided to stay, the Ace would automatically be counted as"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 111,
      "npc" : "Black Jack Dealer",
      "text" : "11 points to give you 15 points total."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 113,
      "npc" : "Black Jack Dealer",
      "text" : "[Dealer]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 114,
      "npc" : "Black Jack Dealer",
      "text" : "If you had decided to pull and received a 9, the ace would"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 115,
      "npc" : "Black Jack Dealer",
      "text" : "automatically be counted as 1 point to give you a total of 14"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 116,
      "npc" : "Black Jack Dealer",
      "text" : "points.  If the Ace was counted as 11 points, you would have a"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 117,
      "npc" : "Black Jack Dealer",
      "text" : "point total over 21 and would have lost."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 119,
      "npc" : "Black Jack Dealer",
      "text" : "[Dealer]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 120,
      "npc" : "Black Jack Dealer",
      "text" : "It is because of the flexibility you have with the 'Ace' that makes"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 121,
      "npc" : "Black Jack Dealer",
      "text" : "it the most powerful card in the game."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 124,
      "npc" : "Black Jack Dealer",
      "text" : "[Dealer]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 125,
      "npc" : "Black Jack Dealer",
      "text" : "Feel free to come back anytime"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 130,
      "npc" : "Black Jack Dealer",
      "text" : "[Dealer]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 131,
      "npc" : "Black Jack Dealer",
      "text" : "Please place your bets..."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "option",
      "line" : 133,
      "npc" : "Black Jack Dealer",
      "text" : "2z"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "option",
